         wrongs={"Both turn the limewater chalky because both fizz.": "Fizzing shows a gas, but only carbon dioxide affects limewater.", "Neither affects limewater; limewater only tests for oxygen.": "Limewater is the test for carbon dioxide.", "Q turns it chalky and P does not.": "It is the carbonate (P) that gives carbon dioxide."},
         hints=["Which gas comes from acid + carbonate? From acid + metal?", "Which of those gases turns limewater chalky?", "Say what happens in each tube."],
